      "code": "CPHWELCOME",
      "order_number": 1,
      "name": "Welcome",
      "subtext": "<p><strong>This is a Mapsurvey demo</strong>, not a survey run by the City of Copenhagen. It takes about three minutes.</p><p>Each step shows one thing Mapsurvey can do, and says which in its title:</p><ol><li>Questions that adapt to earlier answers</li><li>Your own data on the map: rate real cycling bridges</li><li>Mark a place, with a photo</li><li>Draw a route</li><li>See what other people marked, and react</li></ol><p>The map already holds <strong>sample answers</strong>, so you can see how shared results look.</p>",
      "input_type": "html",
      "choices": null,
      "required": false,
